<title>JAPAN: OSE says seeks to list Horiuchi Color.</title>
<headline>OSE says seeks to list Horiuchi Color.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Osaka Securities Exchange (OSE) said on Monday it had applied for permission to the Finance Ministry to list Horiuchi Color Ltd.</p>
<p>Horiuchi Color is likely to be listed on September 17 on the second section of the OSE.</p>
<p>It plans to issue 700,000 new shares and offer 700,000 through a secondary offering, OSE said.</p>
<p>Horiuchi Color offers developing and other services for professional photographers and sells photo-related goods.</p>
</text>
